# wifi.svc's authority (docs/wifi.md "Process structure", "Capability
# layout and key custody"): its role registration (Wi-Fi drivers attach to
# it, controllers call it), devmgr's endpoint for readiness and its log
# publisher, and Config for the Secret family wifi.secret. (passphrases),
# which only this manifest names, read and written. It holds no endpoint to
# any driver: the driver attaches and parks its command waits here.
(Executable_Manifest
  identity => "com.cubit.wifi"
  version => "0.1.0"
  requests => [
    (notification "wifi" Notify_Access.Manage "registration")
    (service "config" "config")
    (service "device-manager" "ready")]
  scopes => [(config [File_Right.Read File_Right.Write] "wifi.secret.")])
